    "plan": "This draft focuses on a methodical, step-by-step approach to debugging the hypothetical retrieval failure, emphasizing the three main areas: chunking, indexing, and query wording. It explicitly states the hypothetical nature of the scenario and adheres to the word count and fact reference requirements."
